{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:59:11Z","created_by_operation":"op_e17d59047d0042ca80734c14b4e77405","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_0d106f000c296b554e29110ea7382c6b5d7bb5bc5e00d2b915d588278142bde6","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"agentsmesh/agentsmesh@1f90b14194d0 snapshot d9e238fa0886609c","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_48fc45f3e7f80870c3923e5fc1b27553b6bcf0eefbef970103396489026ead92","slc_7070a98a5f01936e19a19749b1592407eece1c2835d0e87b18205591b6827203","slc_7eb4e81a878ce003f6d5bdce7f46598741b5a4b2aafddbeab31751932afaec60","slc_858670a550cc1609e8b0f3b53741009395fb03b1bbeb78f91dc9a557554fe3a7","slc_c01c79c030eeeebdf36fbd47eb21a0de85310ff767923f020b6c2c5893d5412b"],"source_ids":["src_426d83554c51520fb75bd307c432fefb"],"text":"The runner CLI exposes login (with --headless and --server options), run, and service install/start subcommands.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:59:11Z","updated_by_operation":"op_e17d59047d0042ca80734c14b4e77405"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:59:11Z","created_by_operation":"op_e17d59047d0042ca80734c14b4e77405","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_2bc41b0538b7a6939c35d3dbd5362414a141ee6c9e27f65af498680de8231727","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=components","setting":"agentsmesh/agentsmesh@1f90b14194d0 snapshot d9e238fa0886609c","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_b6ca2ecfd1d13e1f3225ac591fa15f0b4e966e14671300e6147df11ab9087e06"],"source_ids":["src_426d83554c51520fb75bd307c432fefb"],"text":"Client side includes a Rust core of 10 crates compiled to WASM for web/desktop and exposed to iOS via UniFFI, plus Next.js web, Electron desktop, SwiftUI/TCA iOS, and a web-admin console.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:59:11Z","updated_by_operation":"op_e17d59047d0042ca80734c14b4e77405"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:59:11Z","created_by_operation":"op_e17d59047d0042ca80734c14b4e77405","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_3073488140587ba1b71883fa442aec6c133706190547b3711df2c24474d3665f","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"agentsmesh/agentsmesh@1f90b14194d0 snapshot d9e238fa0886609c","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_41ba54b4f840c2a7f3e0d45780ef210a07a9de104ae1ef93b7a315ebe18623e6"],"source_ids":["src_426d83554c51520fb75bd307c432fefb"],"text":"Pods communicate over channels with @mentions within a bound mesh topology, and tickets on a Kanban board can be bound to pods with progress and MR/PR tracking.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:59:11Z","updated_by_operation":"op_e17d59047d0042ca80734c14b4e77405"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:59:11Z","created_by_operation":"op_e17d59047d0042ca80734c14b4e77405","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_544297cb7fd13bf91d01e3b1292e917184328be5a05b2c4de84c8fc6e2bbf06d","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=orchestration","setting":"agentsmesh/agentsmesh@1f90b14194d0 snapshot d9e238fa0886609c","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_32986783c5251d8589ba6b888ee1241dd65aaa20a4193be4e43c2e89ba322fc8"],"source_ids":["src_426d83554c51520fb75bd307c432fefb"],"text":"Runners advertise capacity (max_concurrent_pods) and pods are scheduled onto a chosen runner or an available one from the pool; each pod gets an isolated Git worktree sandbox, private credentials, and its own branch.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:59:11Z","updated_by_operation":"op_e17d59047d0042ca80734c14b4e77405"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:59:11Z","created_by_operation":"op_e17d59047d0042ca80734c14b4e77405","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_998a48c72462952db8470c2aa4302aa850458369df5533595b1fcb1adacd86af","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"agentsmesh/agentsmesh@1f90b14194d0 snapshot d9e238fa0886609c","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_6297d88b2643a98b67be8594849028422ae33465987b66a8b42a1a42e93930dc","slc_c9a5088f41fe7d1d7a8d18fd975afcd50c0e9751dd33fbb19e70f3ecde37af66"],"source_ids":["src_426d83554c51520fb75bd307c432fefb"],"text":"The architecture splits control plane from data plane: orchestration travels over gRPC with mTLS while terminal I/O streams through a stateless Relay cluster, so the backend never handles PTY bytes.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:59:11Z","updated_by_operation":"op_e17d59047d0042ca80734c14b4e77405"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:59:11Z","created_by_operation":"op_e17d59047d0042ca80734c14b4e77405","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_a5a3ccb0fec004a5312a032d70a8370e130b81a2f0f4c8a523f1b52b7bae37d3","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=orchestration","setting":"agentsmesh/agentsmesh@1f90b14194d0 snapshot d9e238fa0886609c","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_32986783c5251d8589ba6b888ee1241dd65aaa20a4193be4e43c2e89ba322fc8","slc_41ba54b4f840c2a7f3e0d45780ef210a07a9de104ae1ef93b7a315ebe18623e6"],"source_ids":["src_426d83554c51520fb75bd307c432fefb"],"text":"An Autopilot control agent watches a pod, sends the next instruction when it goes idle, enforces iteration caps, keeps decision history, and supports human takeover and handback.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:59:11Z","updated_by_operation":"op_e17d59047d0042ca80734c14b4e77405"}
